GeckoView
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Aquarius links against GeckoView, the Android embedding of Mozilla's Gecko
engine, as a binary dependency:

    org.mozilla.geckoview:geckoview

GeckoView is licensed under the Mozilla Public License, Version 2.0. A copy of
the MPL is available at:

    https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/

Source for the exact GeckoView build this project depends on is published by
Mozilla at:

    https://hg.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/
    https://maven.mozilla.org/maven2/org/mozilla/geckoview/

No file of Mozilla's is modified by this project. The version depended on is
pinned in app/build.gradle.kts.

GeckoView in turn bundles components under other licences, including
LGPL-2.1 media libraries (FFmpeg-derived decoders, libSoundTouch). Their source
is obtainable from the mozilla-central tree above.

